on is the app's own, shortened. Switch profile opens the list of profiles (Parts/Identity/YourProfiles). The page's contents follow the app's code and are not a ruling. Not drawn: Settings on desktop, the Telegram page, and the failure and partial results as screens.\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  )"
